WEBVTT

00:04:27.307 --> 00:04:30.958
Kuhimiza watu kwenda chuo 
ni wazo mzuri.

00:04:30.982 --> 00:04:33.760
Upanuzi wa ufikavu
kwa wasiojiweza

00:04:33.784 --> 00:04:35.148
ni bora zaidi

00:04:35.553 --> 00:04:38.125
Lakini huu si suluhu la kutokuwa na usawe.

00:04:38.948 --> 00:04:44.424
Haina faida kuandaa watu
kupambania ustahi

00:04:44.448 --> 00:04:48.182
ni kuboresha maisha
tunafaa kuzingatia

00:04:48.206 --> 00:04:50.619
kwa watu hawana diploma

00:04:50.643 --> 00:04:54.777
lakini wenye mchango muhimu
katika jamii.

00:04:55.728 --> 00:04:58.172
Tunafaa kufufua usharifu wa kazi.

00:04:58.196 --> 00:05:00.751
na kuiweka kati kwenye siasa zetu